#%PAM-1.0
#
# The greeter's *own* session: greetd starting wlrix-greeter as the wlrix-greeter system
# account, before anybody has logged in. Named by `[default_session] service` in
# wlrix-greeter.toml. See the Arch flavour for why this is shipped rather than left to
# greetd's `greetd-greeter` default.

# No password to check: this is a system account with no login of its own.
auth       required     pam_permit.so

@include common-account
@include common-session
